the Words is a list of text.

the App is a script.

put "a" into Words.
put "b" into Words.
put "c" into Words.

for each x in Words...
    when first?
        log "first " + x.
    or when last?
        log "last " + x.
    or?
        log "mid " + x + " prev " + previous's item + " next " + next's item.
